138370/ss_6f34bc1c98c95a89889fe9ecc27a06d8fc7efe50.1920x1080.jpg?t=1743433623","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138370/ss_6f34bc1c98c95a89889fe9ecc27a06d8fc7efe50.600x338.jpg?t=1743433623"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138370/ss_000d6df7804afbfc028c086c52c43f3fcdcbb806.1920x1080.jpg?t=1743433623","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138370/ss_000d6df7804afbfc028c086c52c43f3fcdcbb806.600x338.jpg?t=1743433623"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138370/de1b0a9156406d7291bf46087d7b8650fe1b6be7/ss_de1b0a9156406d7291bf46087d7b8650fe1b6be7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1743433623","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138370/de1b0a9156406d7291bf46087d7b8650fe1b6be7/ss_de1b0a9156406d7291bf46087d7b8650fe1b6be7.600x338.jpg?t=1743433623"}],"short_description":"Bundle of Joy is a lighthearted, story-rich, minigame romp about becoming a parent during the pandemic. Complete all your child-rearing tasks, manage your stress, find time to rest, survive the day, wake up, and do it all over again. It won't be perfect, but that's ok. You're doing your best.","steam_appid":3138370,"support_info":{"email":"nicholas@essay-games.com","url":"https://essay-games.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://essay-games.com/"}